print "Arithmetic Operations Example".

Set a to 10.
Set b to 5.

print "Addition:".
Set result to a plus b.
print result.

print "Subtraction:".
Set result to a minus b.
print result.

print "Multiplication:".
Set result to a times b.
print result.

print "Division:".
Set result to a divided by b.
print result.

print "Function with multiple operations:".
Define calculate with parameters x and y:
    Set sum to x plus y.
    Set product to x times y.
    Return sum plus product.
End definition.

Set result to Call calculate with 3 and 4.
print result. 